OL,3,AFlights grounded across US as homeland
OL,4,Asecurity secretary says no indication
OL,5,Aof an attack
OL,6,
OL,7,FFlights have been grounded across the
OL,8,FUS due to an air traffic control
OL,9,Fcommunications issue
OL,11,FThere's no indication that this is an
OL,12,Fattack against the US, the homeland
OL,13,Fsecurity secretary says, adding that
OL,14,F"everybody's safe"
OL,16,FUS aviation officials earlier issued an
OL,17,Forder to ground all flights due to
OL,18,F"extraordinary circumstances and for
OL,19,Freasons of safety"
OL,21,FSeveral major airports confirmed the
OL,22,Fground stop
